</gallery></li>
* Direct access from the location selection screen is unlocked upon completing the questline [[Stick to It]]. The requirement for a [[Sudak-Tudak marine repair kit]] still applies.
* The number of encountered [[Black Division]] operatives and [[The Wedge]]'s followers depends on the number of players in the raid. Detailed numbers can be found on the [[Icebreaker#Maps|maps]] below.

==Features==
===Insurance===
All insured items left in a raid by players will not be returned. Upon death, insurance [[Traders]] will send the usual in-game mail about dispatching people to recover the items, but when the insurance timer runs out they will explain that their people don't go to the location, didn't find it or died in the process.

